  "details": "I would really like to not be constantly phased through a lot of the time. As someone with phantom sense, being able to feel someone move through me, its really irritating and uncomfortable.\nThis kind of thing would not only help people who have phantom sense to not have to deal with that.\nBut not only this, but would also be good for when someone is trying to bother someone, if someone stands in the way to protect them, they can't just phase through to charge at them.\nPeople running at me and harassing me when I am having a panic attack has happened and they just move through my friends who try to stop them by body blocking.\nHowever, it would be nice to allow for this to be able to be turned on and off as well. That way you can choose to be solid or not.",
